Output docs/demo/play.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 900
Set Height 540
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 150ms

Hide
Type "make build >/dev/null && export PS1= HOMEROW_DATA=$(mktemp -d)/progress.json && cp docs/demo/progress.json $HOMEROW_DATA && clear && ./bin/homerow"
Enter
Wait+Screen /enter start/
Show
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "k"
Sleep 700ms
Type "d"
Sleep 600ms
Type ";"
Sleep 700ms
Type "j"
Sleep 700ms
Type "f"
Sleep 600ms
Type "s"
Sleep 700ms
Type "k"
Sleep 500ms
Type ";"
Sleep 700ms
Type ";"
Sleep 600ms
Type "d"
Sleep 500ms
Type "d"
Sleep 700ms
Type "a"
Sleep 700ms
Type "f"
Sleep 700ms
Type "j"
Sleep 500ms
Sleep 1.5s
Hide
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
